  exactMappings:
  - 'startSize  <- minSize/maxSize: 0.5..1'
  - 'startLifetime <- minEnergy/maxEnergy: 2..2'
  - startRotation <- rndRotation=False (0..360deg random when true)
  - simulationSpace <- 'Simulate in Worldspace?'=False
  - scalingMode=Shape (legacy did not scale particle size with transform scale)
  - playOnAwake <- m_Emit=True
  - shape -> Sphere radius 1 scale (1, 1, 1)
  - colorAnimation 5 keys -> ColorOverLifetime gradient (keys at 0/25/50/75/100%)
  - sizeGrow=2 -> compound growth, multiplier 9[model 1] - VERIFY growth shape in-engine
  - 'damping=1: documented legacy semantics is NO damping (velocity held constant
    until the particle dies). VOLT left constant - exact.'
  - renderMode Billboard
  - 'renderer copy: material/shadows/probes/sorting/cameraVelocityScale/lengthScale/velocityScale/maxParticleSize'
  - 'NOTE: ''exact'' classifications are static-analysis only - every mapping still
    requires visual verification in-engine.'
  approximations:
  - 'emission rate: legacy re-rolls min..max per emission event; Shuriken min/max
    rate sampling interval differs - verify perceived grain at low rates (1..3/s)'
  - 'UV Animation 4x4 cycles=3 -> TextureSheetAnimation over lifetime; frame timing
    nuances (e.g. non-integer cycles) - VERIFY (worst case: ''LightningStorm'' 4x4
    x3).'
  unsupported:
  - emitterVelocityScale=0.12 is documented as inert unless 'Simulate in Worldspace?'
    is enabled; this system simulates local, so legacy applies no emitter-velocity
    inheritance - nothing converted (V1 mapped it unconditionally and wrongly).
  warnings:
